## Differences and action plan

1. contract.md is stale against contract.json (contract). Add the `xs`/`icon-xs` sizes (24px, 12px font, 12px icon), the `href` prop, recompute the variant matrix, update Realizations (Web built, coverage) and mark Q4 answered. Fix json `targetSize` ("smallest is 32px" -> 24px).
2. Disabled/loading on the `<a>` (code). The anchor has no `aria-disabled`/`aria-busy`; without href it loses link role; hover styles (`:not(:disabled, [aria-disabled])`) still apply because `:disabled` never matches an anchor. Fix: set `aria-disabled="true"` and `role="link"` on the anchor when disabled, `aria-busy`/`aria-disabled` when loading, and include `:host([disabled])`/`[loading]` in the hover exclusion.
3. Cancelled click on the host (code). `host.click()` dispatches on the host and bypasses `#handleClick`, so listeners fire while disabled/loading. Fix: capture-phase click listener on the host that stops the event when disabled or loading (as Input overrides `click()`).
4. Disabled + loading (code). When both, `cursor: progress` wins over `not-allowed` and the spinner/aria-busy show. Fix: render the spinner and aria-busy only when `loading && !isDisabled`; order the cursor rules so disabled wins.
5. `active` state (contract or code). Contract lists it with no tokens; nothing implements it. shadcn has none, so remove it from `states` (documented exclusion) unless a pressed style is wanted.
6. Drift to record (realization.web.drift): `xs` sizes beyond md; button duplicates the form-association logic instead of the shared `FormAssociated` base (md of Input says Button shares it); `--sb-spinner-size` is set from Button.scss:57 (acceptable, document it, or expose a `--sb-button-spinner-size` token that the spinner reads).

Verdict: needs code fix (items 2-4, minor) and a contract update (items 1, 5). No blocking divergence in visuals, tokens or tests.

Status (2026-11-15): fixed in this PR (contract.md no longer lists the removed `active` state); items 1-4 and 6 already fixed (6dfe5c9: link aria-disabled/aria-busy and role, host.click() guarded, disabled wins over loading, contract.md and drift updated).
